[I] DBus menu library

[T] A small little library that was created by pulling out some comon code out
[T] of indicator-applet. It passes a menu structure across DBus so that a
[T] program can create a menu simply without worrying about how it is displayed
[T] on the other side of the bus.

[U] http://people.canonical.com/~agateau/dbusmenu/

[A] DBusmenu Developers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development

[L] LGPL
[V] 18.10.20180917
[P] X -----5---9 128.850

# https://launchpad.net/libdbusmenu/16.04/16.04.0/+download/libdbusmenu-16.04.0.tar.gz is dead
[D] a4aebb6c3e66ffc13f2c7e5ba727daac1d6bc88b718d1fe0dc5d87a4 libdbusmenu_18.10.20180917~bzr492+repack1.orig.tar.xz https://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/libd/libdbusmenu/libdbusmenu_${_pkgver}.orig.tar.xz

autogen=1

pkginstalled valgrind && export HAVE_VALGRIND_TRUE='#' ||
	export HAVE_VALGRIND_FALSE=''

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "-I$(pkgprefix includedir libx11) -L$(pkgprefix libdir libx11)"

var_append confopt ' ' --with-gtk=3
var_append confopt ' ' "--disable-dumper --disable-static --disable-tests"
